Package: rendehR
Title: Multi-Source EHR Harmonization Pipeline
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Marzieh", "Mussavi Rizi", role = "aut"),
    person("Vladyslav", "Shein", email = "vshein@uwaterloo.ca", role = "aut"),
    person("Abel", "Torres-Espin", email = "abel.torresespin@uwaterloo.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Downloads, imports, cohort-filters, and harmonizes ICU EHR data
    from MIMIC-III, MIMIC-IV, and eICU. Domain-specific cohort definitions
    and enrichment logic are user-supplied; spinal cord injury (SCI) research
    is included as a reference implementation.
